[ RVCD: READ A VARIABLE CONTROL DIAL.  GDD1, DESTINATION 07, SELECTS
[ THE ARRAY'S ANALOG INPUT; ON THE AGT/30 SELECTING ONE STARTS THE
[ CONVERTER ADC5, AND ITS RESULT IS S5[15-29] (DPR2SPI P. 41; DPR2BD).
[ CALL:  JPSR RVCD; N     N = DIAL 0-5.  RETURN: AR = THE DIAL, A FRACTION.
RVCD:   0                       [ THE RETURN ADDRESS GOES HERE
        MDAR'I RVCD             [ THE DIAL'S NUMBER
        ARMX                    [ SELECT IT: THE CONVERSION STARTS
        S5AR'H                  [ THE RESULT INTO THE UPPER HALF
        ARRS 17                 [ AND BACK, ITS SIGN EXTENDED
        JUMP'I'X RVCD           [ RETURN PAST THE ARGUMENT
